    },
    "swara_semitones_note": "Offsets in semitones from Sa (tonic), standard 72-melakarta swarasthana numbering. R2/G2 (2/3) and D2/N2 (9/10) are the commonly-used chatushruti/kaisiki variants; enharmonic alternates (R3=G2, G1=R2, D3=N2, N1=D2) are not separately represented here since no raga in this corpus uses the alternate spelling.",
    "sources": [
      "https://www.ragasurabhi.com/carnatic-music/ragas.html (raga selection reference only - no text or audio copied from this site)",
