      "gamaka.py's own precedent: measure real pitch from real audio rather than assume standard tuning - the guitar placeholder samples follow the same principle"
    ],
    "verification_note": "Every raga below was cross-referenced against at least one source independent of ragasurabhi.com before inclusion. Two corrections were caught by this process: Suddha Saveri's parent melakarta (Shankarabharanam, not Harikambhoji as initially assumed) and Bhoopalam's parent melakarta (Hanumatodi, not Mayamalavagowla as initially assumed)."
  },
